  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to the Migration Multi-Partner Trust Fund (MMPTF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pooled funding between BRMM and GCP to contribution funds to the UN&apos;s MMPTF under the migration uplift, which the FS announced earlier this year. MMPTF-funded projects strengthen migration governance, enhance socio-economic opportunities for migrants and host communities, and promote sustainable development outcomes in line with the Global Compact for Migration.</narrative>
  </description>
